id: B01
target: src/sello/private/backend.nim
desc: signDetached: scMulAdd's two SecretScalar operands swapped, S = scMulAdd(k, a, r) [S = k*a + r] computed as scMulAdd(k, r, a) [S = k*r + a] instead -- corrupts the EdDSA signature scalar itself (S = r + k*a per RFC 8032 5.1.6 step 4), a real (non-equivalent) mutation since a (the clamped secret key scalar) and r (the per-message nonce) are different values on every real signature.
====OLD====
    let S = scMulAdd(k, a, r)
====NEW====
    let S = scMulAdd(k, r, a)
====END====
